<!--
  The status-bar icon for an offer.

  🔴 A notification SMALL icon must be a flat white silhouette on
  transparent: the platform masks it to its alpha channel and tints it
  itself. Anything else (a colour icon, or a stock `android.R.drawable.*`
  as this used to be) renders as a grey blob and reads as "some app", not
  as this one — on the one notification a driver is meant to react to
  within 45 seconds.
-->
